    "biography": "<h2>Rogue - Thief — Build Guide</h2>\n<p><em>Core Rulebook v3 Alpha 3, Appendix C. This Hero is built at Level 1 with no Ancestry — pick one, rename the Hero, and adjust anything you like.</em></p>\n<p><strong>Starting Pack note:</strong> Tinker (buy Dagger and Armor)</p>\n<p><strong>Bought with the Starting Pack's silver:</strong> Dagger (10s), Light Armor (50s).</p>\n<h3>Stats at Level 10</h3>\n<p><strong>MIT</strong> 3 · <strong>DEX</strong> 7 · <strong>AWR</strong> 7 · <strong>RSN</strong> 6 · <strong>PRS</strong> 3 · <strong>LUK</strong> 5</p>\n<h3>Perks by Level</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>1st:</strong> Resourceful, Skirmisher <em>(already on this sheet)</em></li>\n<li><strong>3rd:</strong> Master Breaker</li>\n<li><strong>5th:</strong> Deft Hands</li>\n<li><strong>7th:</strong> Treads Lightly</li>\n<li><strong>9th:</strong> Perfect Parry</li>\n</ul>",
