    {
      "name": "Rogue",
      "type": "class",
      "img": "icons/weapons/daggers/dagger-ritual-crooked-crystal.webp",
      "system": {
        "description": "<p><strong>I may be a burglar… but I’m an honest one, I hope, more or less.</strong></p><p><em>—Bilbo Baggins, The Hobbit</em></p><p>Rogues are the back-alley urchins, gutterborn scum, and shadowed assassins. To hammers, every problem looks like a nail. Rogues are blades, and every problem is a throat.</p><h3>Iconic Rogues</h3><ul><li><strong>Locke Lamora</strong>, <em>Gentleman Bastard Sequence</em></li><li><strong>Nona Grey</strong>, <em>Book of the Ancestor</em></li><li><strong>Vin</strong>, <em>Mistborn</em></li><li><strong>Zidane Tribal</strong>, <em>Final Fantasy IX</em></li></ul><h3>Playing Rogue</h3><p>Rogues are low-defense, midline harassers that focus on one single, deadly shot. They are given Features that reinforce attempting to gain Favor on their Attacks.</p><p><strong>Action:</strong> Attack<br /><strong>Move:</strong> Midline<br /><strong>Starting Pack:</strong> Assassin, Conman, Investigator, or Scout<br /><strong>Key Stat:</strong> Dexterity/Awareness, Luck<br /><strong>Complexity:</strong> ★★☆☆☆<br /><strong>Training:</strong> Ranged, Finesse, Sneak</p><h3>Class Features</h3><table class=\"NormalTable\"><tbody><tr><td><p><strong>Level</strong></p></td><td><p><strong>Features</strong></p></td><td><p><strong>Sneak Attack</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td><p>1st</p></td><td><p>Sneak Attack, Infiltrator</p></td><td><p>1d4</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>2nd</p></td><td><p>Evasive</p></td><td><p>1d4</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>3rd</p></td><td><p>Perk</p></td><td><p>1d4</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>4th</p></td><td><p>Knack (1 Luck)</p></td><td><p>2d4</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>5th</p></td><td><p>Perk</p></td><td><p>2d4</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>6th</p></td><td><p>Evasive (15’), Lethal Weapon</p></td><td><p>2d4</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>7th</p></td><td><p>Perk</p></td><td><p>3d4</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>8th</p></td><td><p>Knack (2 Luck)</p></td><td><p>3d4</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>9th</p></td><td><p>Perk</p></td><td><p>3d4</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>10th</p></td><td><p>Evasive (20’), Waylay</p></td><td><p>4d4</p></td></tr></tbody></table>",
        "isSpellcaster": false,
        "levelFeatures": [
          {
            "level": 1,
            "name": "Sneak Attack",
            "description": "<p>The first time you hit with a Favored attack on a Turn with a Finesse, Keen, or Ranged Weapon, it deals extra damage. This extra damage is a number of d4s equal to (your Level divided by 3, round up). The attack also ignores an amount of Armor equal to this number of extra dice.</p>",
